# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Bezplatný kurz IBM o kvantové informaci a výpočtech"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products and projections"
msgstr "Skalární součiny a projekce"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"To better prepare ourselves to explore the capabilities and limitations of quantum circuits, we now introduce some additional mathematical concepts — namely the *inner product* between vectors (and its connection to the Euclidean norm), the notions of *orthogonality* and *orthonormality* for sets of vectors, and *projection* matrices, which will allow us to introduce a handy generalization of standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Biggr, operatorname */}\n"
"Abychom se lépe připravili na prozkoumání možností a omezení kvantových Circuit, představíme si nyní některé další matematické pojmy — konkrétně *skalární součin* mezi vektory (a jeho souvislost s euklidovskou normou), pojmy *ortogonalita* a *ortonormalita* pro množiny vektorů a *projekční* matice, které nám umožní zavést šikovné zobecnění měření ve standardní bázi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Inner products {#inner-products}"
msgstr "Skalární součiny {#inner-products}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recall that when we use the Dirac notation to refer to an arbitrary column "
"vector as a ket, such as\n"
msgstr ""
"Připomeň si, že když v Diracově notaci označujeme libovolný sloupcový vektor"
" jako ket, například\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"the corresponding bra vector is the *conjugate transpose* of this vector:\n"
msgstr "odpovídající bra vektor je *konjugovaná transpozice* tohoto vektoru:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"=\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if we have some classical state set $\\Sigma$ in mind, and we express a column vector as a ket,\n"
"such as\n"
msgstr ""
"Případně, pokud máme na mysli nějakou množinu klasických stavů $\\Sigma$ a vyjádříme sloupcový vektor jako ket,\n"
"například\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then the corresponding row (or bra) vector is the conjugate transpose\n"
msgstr "pak odpovídající řádkový (nebo bra) vektor je konjugovaná transpozice\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert.\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We also have that the product of a bra vector and a ket vector, viewed as matrices either having a single row or a single column, results in a scalar.\n"
"Specifically, if we have two column vectors\n"
msgstr ""
"Také platí, že součin bra vektoru a ket vektoru, na které se díváme jako na matice s jedním řádkem nebo jedním sloupcem, dává skalár.\n"
"Konkrétně, pokud máme dva sloupcové vektory\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_1\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "so that the row vector $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is as in equation $(1),$ then\n"
msgstr "takže řádkový vektor $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ je jako v rovnici $(1),$ pak\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"= \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_1} & \\overline{\\alpha_2} & \\cdots & \\overline{\\alpha_n}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\beta_1\\\\\n"
"\\beta_2\\\\\n"
"\\vdots\\\\\n"
"\\beta_n\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\beta_1 + \\cdots + \\overline{\\alpha_n}\\beta_n.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively, if we have two column vectors that we have written as\n"
msgstr "Případně, pokud máme dva sloupcové vektory, které jsme zapsali jako\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "so that $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ is the row vector $(2),$ we find that\n"
msgstr "takže $\\langle \\psi \\vert$ je řádkový vektor $(2),$ zjistíme, že\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle & = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)\n"
"  \\Biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b\\rangle\\Biggr)\\\\\n"
"  & =\n"
"  \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma}\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_b \\langle a \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"  & = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the last equality follows from the observation that $\\langle a \\vert"
" a \\rangle = 1$ and $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$ for classical states"
" $a$ and $b$ satisfying $a\\neq b.$\n"
msgstr ""
"kde poslední rovnost plyne z pozorování, že $\\langle a \\vert a \\rangle = "
"1$ a $\\langle a \\vert b \\rangle = 0$ pro klasické stavy $a$ a $b$ "
"splňující $a\\neq b.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The value $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$ is called the *inner product* between the vectors $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle.$\n"
"Inner products are critically important in quantum information and computation;\n"
"we would not get far in understanding quantum information at a mathematical level without them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hodnota $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle$ se nazývá *skalární součin* vektorů $\\vert \\psi\\rangle$ a $\\vert \\phi \\rangle.$\n"
"Skalární součiny jsou v kvantové informaci a výpočtech naprosto zásadní;\n"
"bez nich bychom se v pochopení kvantové informace na matematické úrovni daleko nedostali.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us now collect together some basic facts about inner products of "
"vectors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Shromážděme nyní některé základní fakty o skalárních součinech vektorů.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Relationship to the Euclidean norm.** The inner product of any vector\n"
msgstr "**Vztah k euklidovské normě.** Skalární součin libovolného vektoru\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   with itself is\n"
msgstr "   se sebou samým je\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\alpha_a\n"
"   = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert\\alpha_a\\vert^2\n"
"   = \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Thus, the Euclidean norm of a vector may alternatively be expressed as\n"
msgstr "   Euklidovskou normu vektoru tedy můžeme alternativně vyjádřit jako\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\| \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| = \\sqrt{ \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle }.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Notice that the Euclidean norm of a vector must always be a nonnegative real number.\n"
"   Moreover, the only way the Euclidean norm of a vector can be equal to zero is if every one of the entries is equal to zero, which is to say that the vector is the zero vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Všimni si, že euklidovská norma vektoru musí být vždy nezáporné reálné číslo.\n"
"   Navíc jediný způsob, jak může být euklidovská norma vektoru rovna nule, je ten, že každá její složka je rovna nule, což znamená, že vektor je nulový vektor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   We can summarize these observations like this: for every vector $\\vert "
"\\psi \\rangle$ we have\n"
msgstr ""
"   Tato pozorování můžeme shrnout takto: pro každý vektor $\\vert \\psi "
"\\rangle$ platí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\geq 0,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   with $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$ if and only if $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0.$\n"
"   This property of the inner product is sometimes referred to as _positive definiteness_.\n"
msgstr ""
"   přičemž $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0$ právě tehdy, když $\\vert \\psi \\rangle = 0.$\n"
"   Tato vlastnost skalárního součinu se někdy označuje jako _pozitivní definitnost_.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Conjugate symmetry.** For any two vectors\n"
msgstr "**Konjugovaná symetrie.** Pro libovolné dva vektory\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\alpha_a \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\beta_b \\vert b \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   we have\n"
msgstr "   platí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\alpha_a} \\beta_a\n"
"   \\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"   \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\overline{\\beta_a} \\alpha_a,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   and therefore\n"
msgstr "   a proto\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\overline{\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle} = \\langle \\phi \\vert \\psi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Linearity in the second argument (and conjugate linearity in the first).**\n"
"Let us suppose that $\\vert \\psi \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle,$ and $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$ are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers. If we define a new vector\n"
msgstr ""
"**Linearita v druhém argumentu (a konjugovaná linearita v prvním).**\n"
"Předpokládejme, že $\\vert \\psi \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle,$ a $\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle$ jsou vektory a $\\alpha_1$ a $\\alpha_2$ jsou komplexní čísla. Pokud definujeme nový vektor\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\phi\\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\phi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\phi_2\\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   then\n"
msgstr "   pak\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   = \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigl( \\alpha_1\\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2\\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"   = \\alpha_1 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_1 \\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi_2 \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   That is to say, the inner product is _linear_ in the second argument.\n"
"   This can be verified either through the formulas above or simply by noting that matrix multiplication is linear in each argument (and specifically in the second argument).\n"
msgstr ""
"   To znamená, že skalární součin je _lineární_ v druhém argumentu.\n"
"   To znamená, že vnitřní součin je _lineární_ ve druhém argumentu.\n"
"   To lze ověřit buď pomocí výše uvedených vzorců, nebo jednoduše tím, že si uvědomíš, že násobení matic je lineární v každém argumentu (a konkrétně ve druhém argumentu).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Combining this fact with conjugate symmetry reveals that the inner "
"product is _conjugate linear_ in the first argument. That is, if $\\vert "
"\\psi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,$ and $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ "
"are vectors and $\\alpha_1$ and $\\alpha_2$ are complex numbers, and we "
"define\n"
msgstr ""
"   Kombinací tohoto faktu s konjugovanou symetrií zjistíme, že vnitřní "
"součin je _konjugovaně lineární_ v prvním argumentu. To znamená, že pokud "
"$\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle,$ $\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,$ a $\\vert \\phi "
"\\rangle$ jsou vektory a $\\alpha_1$ a $\\alpha_2$ jsou komplexní čísla, a "
"definujeme\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\alpha_1 \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle + \\alpha_2 \\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle,\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   =\n"
"   \\bigl( \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\bigr)\n"
"   \\vert\\phi\\rangle\n"
"   = \\overline{\\alpha_1} \\langle \\psi_1 \\vert \\phi \\rangle + \\overline{\\alpha_2} \\langle \\psi_2 \\vert \\phi \\rangle.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The Cauchy–Schwarz inequality.**\n"
"For every choice of vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ having the same number of entries, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"**Cauchyho–Schwarzova nerovnost.**\n"
"Pro libovolnou volbu vektorů $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ a $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ se stejným počtem složek platí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\bigl\\vert \\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle\\bigr| \\leq \\bigl\\| \\vert\\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\| \\bigl\\| \\vert \\phi \\rangle\n"
"   \\bigr\\|.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This is an incredibly handy inequality that gets used quite extensively "
"in quantum information (and in many other topics of study).\n"
msgstr ""
"   Toto je neuvěřitelně užitečná nerovnost, která se velmi často používá v "
"kvantové informatice (a v mnoha dalších oblastech studia).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Orthogonal and orthonormal sets {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"
msgstr "Ortogonální a ortonormální množiny {#orthogonal-and-orthonormal-sets}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two vectors $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ and $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ are said to "
"be *orthogonal* if their inner product is zero:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dva vektory $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ a $\\vert \\psi \\rangle$ se nazývají "
"*ortogonální*, pokud je jejich vnitřní součin nulový:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi \\vert \\phi \\rangle = 0.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Geometrically, we can think about orthogonal vectors as vectors at right "
"angles to each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"Geometricky si ortogonální vektory můžeš představit jako vektory, které jsou"
" na sebe kolmé.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthogonal set* if every vector in the set is orthogonal to every other vector in the set.\n"
"That is, this set is orthogonal if\n"
msgstr ""
"Množina vektorů $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ se nazývá *ortogonální množina*, pokud je každý vektor v množině ortogonální ke každému jinému vektoru v množině.\n"
"To znamená, že tato množina je ortogonální, pokud\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle = 0\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$ for which $j\\neq k.$\n"
msgstr "pro všechny volby $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$, pro které $j\\neq k.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A set of vectors $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is called an *orthonormal* set if it is an orthogonal set and, in addition, every vector in the set is a unit vector.\n"
"Alternatively, this set is an orthonormal set if we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Množina vektorů $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ se nazývá *ortonormální* množina, pokud je ortogonální množinou a navíc je každý vektor v množině jednotkovým vektorem.\n"
"Alternativně je tato množina ortonormální, pokud platí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\psi_j \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & j = k\\\\[1mm]\n"
"0 & j\\neq k\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\tag{3}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all choices of $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}.$\n"
msgstr "pro všechny volby $j,k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, a set $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an *orthonormal basis* if, in addition to being an orthonormal set, it forms a basis.\n"
"This is equivalent to $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ being an orthonormal set and $m$ being equal to the dimension of the space from which $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nakonec, množina $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ je *ortonormální báze*, pokud je kromě toho, že je ortonormální množinou, také bází.\n"
"To je ekvivalentní tomu, že $\\{ \\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ je ortonormální množina a $m$ se rovná dimenzi prostoru, ze kterého jsou vektory $\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ vybrány.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, for any classical state set $\\Sigma,$ the set of all standard "
"basis vectors\n"
msgstr ""
"Například pro libovolnou množinu klasických stavů $\\Sigma$ tvoří množina "
"všech vektorů standardní báze\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\big\\{ \\vert a \\rangle \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is an orthonormal basis.\n"
"The set $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $2$-dimensional space corresponding to a single qubit, and the Bell basis $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal basis for the $4$-dimensional space corresponding to two qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"ortonormální bázi.\n"
"Množina $\\{\\vert+\\rangle,\\vert-\\rangle\\}$ je ortonormální bází $2$-dimenzionálního prostoru odpovídajícího jednomu qubit, a Bellova báze $\\{\\vert\\phi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\phi^-\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^+\\rangle, \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\}$ je ortonormální bází $4$-dimenzionálního prostoru odpovídajícího dvěma qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Extending orthonormal sets to orthonormal bases {#extending-orthonormal-"
"sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"
msgstr ""
"Rozšíření ortonormálních množin na ortonormální báze {#extending-"
"orthonormal-sets-to-orthonormal-bases}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Suppose that $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ are vectors that live in an $n$-dimensional space, and assume moreover that $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is an orthonormal set.\n"
"Orthonormal sets are always linearly independent sets, so these vectors necessarily span a subspace of dimension $m.$\n"
"From this we conclude that $m\\leq n$ because the dimension of the subspace spanned by these vectors cannot be larger than the dimension of the entire space from which they're drawn.\n"
msgstr ""
"Předpokládej, že $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle$ jsou vektory žijící v $n$-dimenzionálním prostoru, a předpokládej navíc, že $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ je ortonormální množina.\n"
"Ortonormální množiny jsou vždy lineárně nezávislé množiny, takže tyto vektory nutně generují podprostor dimenze $m.$\n"
"Z toho vyplývá, že $m\\leq n$, protože dimenze podprostoru generovaného těmito vektory nemůže být větší než dimenze celého prostoru, ze kterého jsou vybrány.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If it is the case that $m<n,$ then it is always possible to choose an additional $n-m$ vectors\n"
"$\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ so that\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ forms an orthonormal basis.\n"
"A procedure known as the *Gram–Schmidt orthogonalization process* can be used to construct these vectors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud platí $m<n,$ pak je vždy možné zvolit dalších $n-m$ vektorů\n"
"$\\vert \\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ tak, aby\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ tvořilo ortonormální bázi.\n"
"K sestrojení těchto vektorů lze použít proceduru známou jako *Gramův–Schmidtův ortogonalizační proces*.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orthonormal sets and unitary matrices {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-"
"matrices}"
msgstr ""
"Ortonormální množiny a unitární matice {#orthonormal-sets-and-unitary-"
"matrices}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orthonormal sets of vectors are closely connected with unitary matrices.\n"
"One way to express this connection is to say that the following three statements are logically equivalent (meaning that they are all true or all false) for any choice of a square matrix $U$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ortonormální množiny vektorů jsou úzce spjaty s unitárními maticemi.\n"
"Jeden ze způsobů, jak vyjádřit tuto souvislost, je říci, že následující tři tvrzení jsou logicky ekvivalentní (což znamená, že jsou buď všechna pravdivá, nebo všechna nepravdivá) pro libovolnou volbu čtvercové matice $U$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The matrix $U$ is unitary (that is, $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U "
"U^{\\dagger}$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Matice $U$ je unitární (tedy $U^{\\dagger} U = \\mathbb{I} = U "
"U^{\\dagger}$).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The rows of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "Řádky matice $U$ tvoří ortonormální množinu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The columns of $U$ form an orthonormal set.\n"
msgstr "Sloupce matice $U$ tvoří ortonormální množinu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equivalence is actually pretty straightforward when we think about how matrix multiplication and the conjugate transpose work.\n"
"Suppose, for instance, that we have a $3\\times 3$ matrix like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tato ekvivalence je vlastně dost přímočará, když se zamyslíš nad tím, jak funguje násobení matic a konjugovaná transpozice.\n"
"Předpokládej například, že máme matici $3\\times 3$ jako je tato:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The conjugate transpose of $U$ looks like this:\n"
msgstr "Konjugovaná transpozice $U$ vypadá takto:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Multiplying the two matrices, with the conjugate transpose on the left-hand "
"side, gives us this matrix:\n"
msgstr ""
"Vynásobením obou matic, s konjugovanou transpozicí na levé straně, dostaneme"
" tuto matici:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"&\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}} & \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1} & \\alpha_{1,2} & \\alpha_{1,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1} & \\alpha_{2,2} & \\alpha_{2,3} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1} & \\alpha_{3,2} & \\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\\\[4mm]\n"
"\\quad &=\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,1}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,1}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,1}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,2}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,2}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,2}}\\alpha_{3,3} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,1} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,1} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,2} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,2} &\n"
"\\overline{\\alpha_{1,3}}\\alpha_{1,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{2,3}}\\alpha_{2,3} + \\overline{\\alpha_{3,3}}\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If we form three vectors from the columns of $U,$\n"
msgstr "Pokud ze sloupců $U$ vytvoříme tři vektory,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,1}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_2\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,2}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\vert \\psi_3\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{1,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{2,3}\\\\\n"
"\\alpha_{3,3}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then we can alternatively express the product above as follows:\n"
msgstr "pak můžeme výše uvedený součin alternativně vyjádřit takto:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger} U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_1\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_2\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"\\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_1 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_2 \\rangle & \\langle \\psi_3\\vert \\psi_3 \\rangle\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Referring to the equation $(3),$ we now see that the condition that this "
"matrix is equal to the identity matrix is equivalent to the orthonormality "
"of the set "
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"S odkazem na rovnici $(3)$ nyní vidíme, že podmínka, aby tato matice byla "
"rovna jednotkové matici, je ekvivalentní ortonormalitě množiny "
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_2\\rangle,\\vert\\psi_3\\rangle\\}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This argument generalizes to unitary matrices of any size.\n"
"The fact that the rows of a matrix form an orthonormal basis if and only if the matrix is unitary then follows from the fact that a matrix is unitary if and only if its transpose is unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento argument se zobecňuje na unitární matice libovolné velikosti.\n"
"Fakt, že řádky matice tvoří ortonormální bázi právě tehdy, když je matice unitární, pak plyne z toho, že matice je unitární právě tehdy, když je unitární její transpozice.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given the equivalence described above, together with the fact that every orthonormal set can be extended to form an orthonormal basis, we conclude the following useful fact:\n"
"Given any orthonormal set of vectors $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ drawn from an $n$-dimensional space, there exists a unitary matrix $U$ whose first $m$ columns are the vectors $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle.$\n"
"Pictorially, we can always find a unitary matrix having this form:\n"
msgstr ""
"Vzhledem k výše popsané ekvivalenci spolu s faktem, že každou ortonormální množinu lze rozšířit na ortonormální bázi, dospějeme k následujícímu užitečnému faktu:\n"
"Pro libovolnou ortonormální množinu vektorů $\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ z $n$-dimenzionálního prostoru existuje unitární matice $U$, jejíž prvních $m$ sloupců tvoří vektory $\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_m\\rangle.$\n"
"Obrazně řečeno, vždy můžeme najít unitární matici v tomto tvaru:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\left(\n"
"  \\begin{array}{ccccccc}\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\\\\\n"
"    \\vert\\psi_1\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_2\\rangle & \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_m\\rangle & \\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle &\n"
"    \\cdots & \\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"    \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt} & & \\rule{0.4pt}{10pt}\n"
"  \\end{array}\n"
"\\right).\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, the last $n-m$ columns are filled in with any choice of vectors $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$ that make\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ an orthonormal basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zde je posledních $n-m$ sloupců doplněno libovolnou volbou vektorů $\\vert\\psi_{m+1}\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle$, které z\n"
"$\\{\\vert\\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_n\\rangle\\}$ udělají ortonormální bázi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Projections and projective measurements {#projections-and-projective-"
"measurements}"
msgstr ""
"Projekce a projektivní měření {#projections-and-projective-measurements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Projection matrices {#projection-matrices}"
msgstr "Projekční matice {#projection-matrices}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A square matrix $\\Pi$ is called a *projection* if it satisfies two "
"properties:\n"
msgstr ""
"Čtvercová matice $\\Pi$ se nazývá *projekce*, pokud splňuje dvě "
"vlastnosti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}.$\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi = \\Pi^{\\dagger}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi.$\n"
msgstr "$\\Pi^2 = \\Pi.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Matrices that satisfy the first condition — that they are equal to their own"
" conjugate transpose — are called *Hermitian matrices*, and matrices that "
"satisfy the second condition — that squaring them leaves them unchanged — "
"are called *idempotent* matrices.\n"
msgstr ""
"Matice, které splňují první podmínku — tedy že se rovnají své vlastní "
"konjugované transpozici — se nazývají *hermitovské matice*, a matice, které "
"splňují druhou podmínku — tedy že umocnění je nezmění — se nazývají "
"*idempotentní* matice.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As a word of caution, the word *projection* is sometimes used to refer to any matrix that satisfies just the second condition but not necessarily the first, and when this is done the term *orthogonal projection* is typically used to refer to matrices satisfying both properties.\n"
"In the context of quantum information and computation, however, the terms *projection* and *projection matrix* more typically refer to matrices satisfying both conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Na upozornění: slovo *projekce* se někdy používá pro jakoukoli matici, která splňuje pouze druhou podmínku, ale ne nutně první, a v tom případě se termín *ortogonální projekce* obvykle používá pro matice splňující obě vlastnosti.\n"
"V kontextu kvantové informatiky a výpočtů však termíny *projekce* a *projekční matice* typicky označují matice splňující obě podmínky.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "An example of a projection is the matrix\n"
msgstr "Příkladem projekce je matice\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\n"
"\\tag{4}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for any unit vector $\\vert \\psi\\rangle.$\n"
"We can see that this matrix is Hermitian as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"pro libovolný jednotkový vektor $\\vert \\psi\\rangle.$\n"
"To, že tato matice je hermitovská, můžeš vidět takto:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger} = \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\bigl( \\langle \\psi \\vert \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here, to obtain the second equality, we have used the formula\n"
msgstr "Zde jsme k získání druhé rovnosti použili vzorec\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(A B)^{\\dagger} = B^{\\dagger} A^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which is always true, for any two matrices $A$ and $B$ for which the product"
" $AB$ makes sense.\n"
msgstr ""
"který platí vždy, pro libovolné dvě matice $A$ a $B$, pro které má součin "
"$AB$ smysl.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see that the matrix $\\Pi$ in $(4)$ is idempotent, we can use the assumption that $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is a unit vector, so that it satisfies $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1.$\n"
"Thus, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Abychom viděli, že matice $\\Pi$ v $(4)$ je idempotentní, můžeme použít předpoklad, že $\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ je jednotkový vektor, takže splňuje $\\langle \\psi \\vert \\psi\\rangle = 1.$\n"
"Tedy máme\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"= \\bigl( \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert \\bigr)^2\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle \\psi\\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert\n"
"= \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\langle\\psi\\vert = \\Pi.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"More generally, if $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ is any orthonormal set of vectors, then the matrix\n"
msgstr ""
"Obecněji, pokud $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ je libovolná ortonormální množina vektorů, pak matice\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{5}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is a projection.\n"
"Specifically, we have\n"
msgstr ""
"je projekce.\n"
"Konkrétně máme\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^{\\dagger}\n"
"&= \\biggl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\bigl(\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k\\vert\\bigr)^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"&= \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and\n"
msgstr "a\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi^2\n"
"& = \\biggl( \\sum_{j = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{j = 1}^m\\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_j\\rangle \\langle \\psi_j \\vert  \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 1}^m \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\Pi,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the orthonormality of $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ implies the second-to-last equality.\n"
msgstr ""
"kde ortonormalita $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert "
"\\psi_m\\rangle\\}$ implikuje předposlední rovnost.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In fact, this exhausts all of the possibilities: *every* projection $\\Pi$ can be written in the form $(5)$ for some choice of an orthonormal set $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}.$\n"
"(Technically speaking, the zero matrix $\\Pi=0,$ which is a projection, is a special case.\n"
"To fit it into the general form $(5)$ we must allow the possibility that the sum is empty, resulting in the zero matrix.)\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve skutečnosti tím jsou vyčerpány všechny možnosti: *každou* projekci $\\Pi$ lze zapsat ve tvaru $(5)$ pro nějakou volbu ortonormální množiny $\\{\\vert \\psi_1\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert \\psi_m\\rangle\\}.$\n"
"(Technicky vzato, nulová matice $\\Pi=0,$ která je projekcí, je speciální případ.\n"
"Aby se vešla do obecného tvaru $(5)$, musíme připustit možnost, že součet je prázdný, což dává nulovou matici.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Projective measurements {#projective-measurements}"
msgstr "Projektivní měření {#projective-measurements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The notion of a measurement of a quantum system is more general than just standard basis measurements.\n"
"*Projective measurements* are measurements that are described by a collection of projections whose sum is equal to the identity matrix.\n"
"In symbols, a collection $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ of projection matrices describes a projective measurement if\n"
msgstr ""
"Pojem měření kvantového systému je obecnější než jen měření ve standardní bázi.\n"
"*Projektivní měření* jsou měření, která jsou popsána kolekcí projekcí, jejichž součet se rovná jednotkové matici.\n"
"Symbolicky, kolekce $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ projekčních matic popisuje projektivní měření, pokud\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 + \\cdots + \\Pi_{m-1} = \\mathbb{I}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When such a measurement is performed on a system $\\mathsf{X}$ while it is "
"in some state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ two things happen:\n"
msgstr ""
"Když se takové měření provede na systému $\\mathsf{X}$, který je v nějakém "
"stavu $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ stanou se dvě věci:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For each $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},$ the outcome of the measurement is $k$ "
"with probability equal to\n"
msgstr ""
"Pro každé $k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ je výsledek měření $k$ s "
"pravděpodobností rovnou\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $k$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For whichever outcome $k$ the measurement produces, the state of "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "Pro ten výsledek $k$, který měření dá, se stav $\\mathsf{X}$ změní na\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_k \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can also choose outcomes other than $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ for projective measurements if we wish.\n"
"More generally, for any finite and nonempty set $\\Sigma,$ if we have a collection of projection matrices\n"
msgstr ""
"Můžeme si také zvolit jiné výsledky než $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$ pro projektivní měření, pokud chceme.\n"
"Obecněji, pro libovolnou konečnou a neprázdnou množinu $\\Sigma,$ pokud máme kolekci projekčních matic\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\{\\Pi_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "that satisfies the condition\n"
msgstr "která splňuje podmínku\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\Pi_a = \\mathbb{I},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"then this collection describes a projective measurement whose possible "
"outcomes coincide with the set $\\Sigma,$ where the rules are the same as "
"before:\n"
msgstr ""
"pak tato kolekce popisuje projektivní měření, jehož možné výsledky "
"odpovídají množině $\\Sigma,$ kde pravidla jsou stejná jako předtím:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For each $a\\in\\Sigma,$ the outcome of the measurement is $a$ with "
"probability equal to\n"
msgstr "Pro každé $a\\in\\Sigma$ je výsledek měření $a$ s pravděpodobností rovnou\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\operatorname{Pr}\\bigl(\\text{outcome is $a$}\\bigr) = \\bigl\\| \\Pi_a \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\bigr\\|^2.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For whichever outcome $a$ the measurement produces, the state of "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ becomes\n"
msgstr "Pro ten výsledek $a$, který měření dá, se stav $\\mathsf{X}$ změní na\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\frac{\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\|\\Pi_a \\vert\\psi\\rangle\\bigr\\|}.\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, standard basis measurements are equivalent to projective measurements, where $\\Sigma$ is the set of classical states of whatever system $\\mathsf{X}$ we're talking about and our set of projection matrices is\n"
"$\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Například měření ve standardní bázi jsou ekvivalentní projektivním měřením, kde $\\Sigma$ je množina klasických stavů toho systému $\\mathsf{X}$, o kterém mluvíme, a naše množina projekčních matic je\n"
"$\\{\\vert a\\rangle\\langle a\\vert:a\\in\\Sigma\\}.$Dalším příkladem projektivního měření, tentokrát na dvou Qubitech $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}),$ je množina\n"
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\},$ kde\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another example of a projective measurement, this time on two qubits $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}),$ is given by the set\n"
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\Pi_1\\},$ where\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Pi_0 = \\vert \\phi^+\\rangle\\langle \\phi^+ \\vert + \\vert \\phi^-\\rangle\\langle \\phi^- \\vert + \\vert \\psi^+\\rangle\\langle \\psi^+ \\vert\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"\\Pi_1 = \\vert\\psi^-\\rangle\\langle\\psi^-\\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud máme více systémů, které jsou společně v nějakém kvantovém stavu, a "
"projektivní měření se provede pouze na jednom ze systémů, je výsledek "
"podobný tomu, co jsme měli pro měření ve standardní bázi — a ve skutečnosti "
"nyní můžeme tento účinek popsat mnohem jednodušeji než dříve.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we have multiple systems that are jointly in some quantum state and a "
"projective measurement is performed on just one of the systems, the action "
"is similar to what we had for standard basis measurements — and in fact we "
"can now describe this action in much simpler terms than we could before.\n"
msgstr ""
"Přesněji řečeno, předpokládejme, že máme dva systémy $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ v kvantovém stavu $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ a projektivní měření popsané kolekcí $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ se provede na systému $\\mathsf{X},$ zatímco se systémem $\\mathsf{Y}$ se nic neděje.\n"
"Provedení tohoto je pak ekvivalentní provedení projektivního měření popsaného kolekcí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be precise, let us suppose that we have two systems $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ in a quantum state $\\vert\\psi\\rangle,$ and a projective measurement described by a collection $\\{\\Pi_a : a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ is performed on the system $\\mathsf{X},$ while nothing is done to $\\mathsf{Y}.$\n"
"Doing this is then equivalent to performing the projective measurement described by the collection\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\{ \\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I} \\,:\\, a\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"na společném systému $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
"Každý výsledek měření $a$ nastane s pravděpodobností\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"on the joint system $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
"Each measurement outcome $a$ results with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"a podmíněno výsledkem $a$ se stav společného systému "
"$(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ změní na\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and conditioned on the result $a$ appearing, the state of the joint system "
"$(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y})$ becomes\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{(\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| (\\Pi_a \\otimes \\mathbb{I})\\vert \\psi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Implementing projective measurements {#implementing-projective-measurements}"
msgstr ""
"Implementace projektivních měření {#implementing-projective-measurements}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Arbitrary projective measurements can be implemented using unitary "
"operations, standard basis measurements, and an extra workspace system, as "
"will now be explained.\n"
msgstr ""
"Libovolná projektivní měření lze implementovat pomocí unitárních operací, "
"měření ve standardní bázi a extra pracovního systému, jak bude nyní "
"vysvětleno.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us suppose that $\\mathsf{X}$ is a system and "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a projective measurement on "
"$\\mathsf{X}.$ We can easily generalize this discussion to projective "
"measurements having different sets of outcomes, but in the interest of "
"convenience and simplicity we will assume the set of possible outcomes for "
"our measurement is $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Předpokládejme, že $\\mathsf{X}$ je systém a "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ je projektivní měření na $\\mathsf{X}.$ "
"Tuto diskuzi můžeme snadno zobecnit na projektivní měření s různými "
"množinami výsledků, ale v zájmu pohodlí a jednoduchosti budeme předpokládat,"
" že množina možných výsledků našeho měření je $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let us note explicitly that $m$ is not necessarily equal to the number of "
"classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$ — we'll let $n$ be the number of classical"
" states of $\\mathsf{X},$ which means that each matrix $\\Pi_k$ is an "
"$n\\times n$ projection matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"Poznamenejme výslovně, že $m$ nemusí být nutně rovno počtu klasických stavů "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ — počet klasických stavů $\\mathsf{X}$ označíme $n,$ což "
"znamená, že každá matice $\\Pi_k$ je projekční matice $n\\times n.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because we assume that $\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ represents a "
"projective measurement, it is necessarily the case that\n"
msgstr ""
"Protože předpokládáme, že $\\{\\Pi_0\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ představuje "
"projektivní měření, nutně platí\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\Pi_k = \\mathbb{I}_n.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to perform a process that has the same effect as performing this"
" projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X},$ but to do this using only unitary "
"operations and standard basis measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Naším cílem je provést proces, který má stejný efekt jako provedení tohoto "
"projektivního měření na $\\mathsf{X},$ ale dosáhnout toho pouze pomocí "
"unitárních operací a měření ve standardní bázi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will make use of an extra workspace system $\\mathsf{Y}$ to do this, and specifically we'll take the classical state set of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to be $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},$ which is the same as the set of outcomes of the projective measurement.\n"
"The idea is that we will perform a standard basis measurement on $\\mathsf{Y},$ and interpret the outcome of this measurement as being equivalent to the outcome of the projective measurement on $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
"We'll need to assume that $\\mathsf{Y}$ is initialized to some fixed state, which we'll choose to be $\\vert 0\\rangle.$\n"
"(Any other choice of fixed quantum state vector could be made to work, but choosing $\\vert 0\\rangle$ makes the explanation to follow much simpler.)\n"
msgstr ""
"K tomu využijeme extra pracovní systém $\\mathsf{Y},$ a konkrétně zvolíme množinu klasických stavů $\\mathsf{Y}$ jako $\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},$ což je stejná množina jako množina výsledků projektivního měření.\n"
"Myšlenka je taková, že provedeme měření ve standardní bázi na $\\mathsf{Y}$ a výsledek tohoto měření budeme interpretovat jako ekvivalent výsledku projektivního měření na $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
"Budeme muset předpokládat, že $\\mathsf{Y}$ je inicializován do nějakého pevného stavu, který zvolíme jako $\\vert 0\\rangle.$\n"
"(Jakákoliv jiná volba pevného kvantového stavového vektoru by také fungovala, ale volba $\\vert 0\\rangle$ výrazně zjednoduší následující vysvětlení.)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Of course, in order for a standard basis measurement of $\\mathsf{Y}$ to tell us anything about $\\mathsf{X},$ we will need to allow $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y}$ to interact somehow before measuring $\\mathsf{Y},$ by performing a unitary operation on the system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X}).$\n"
"First consider this matrix:\n"
msgstr ""
"Aby nám samozřejmě měření $\\mathsf{Y}$ ve standardní bázi něco řeklo o $\\mathsf{X},$ budeme muset nechat $\\mathsf{X}$ a $\\mathsf{Y}$ před měřením $\\mathsf{Y}$ nějakým způsobem interagovat, a to provedením unitární operace na systému $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X}).$\n"
"Nejprve uvažujme tuto matici:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\Pi_k.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Expressed explicitly as a so-called *block matrix*, which is essentially a "
"matrix of matrices that we interpret as a single, larger matrix, $M$ looks "
"like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Vyjádřena explicitně jako takzvaná *bloková matice*, což je v podstatě "
"matice matic, kterou interpretujeme jako jednu větší matici, vypadá $M$ "
"takto:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & 0 & \\cdots & 0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & 0 & \\cdots & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, each $0$ represents an $n\\times n$ matrix filled entirely with zeros,"
" so that the entire matrix $M$ is an $nm\\times nm$ matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"Zde každá $0$ představuje matici $n\\times n$ vyplněnou zcela nulami, takže "
"celá matice $M$ je matice $nm\\times nm.$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, $M$ is certainly not a unitary matrix (unless $m=1,$ in which case "
"$\\Pi_0 = \\mathbb{I},$ giving $M = \\mathbb{I}$ in this trivial case) "
"because unitary matrices cannot have any columns (or rows) that are entirely"
" $0;$ unitary matrices have columns that form orthonormal bases, and the "
"all-zero vector is not a unit vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"$M$ rozhodně není unitární matice (pokud $m=1,$ v tom případě $\\Pi_0 = "
"\\mathbb{I},$ což dává $M = \\mathbb{I}$ v tomto triviálním případě), "
"protože unitární matice nemohou mít žádné sloupce (ani řádky), které jsou "
"celé $0;$ unitární matice mají sloupce tvořící ortonormální bázi, a nulový "
"vektor není jednotkový vektor.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, it is the case that the first $n$ columns of $M$ are orthonormal, and we get this from the assumption that $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ is a measurement.\n"
"To verify this claim, notice that for each $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},$ the vector formed by column number $j$ of $M$ is as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nicméně prvních $n$ sloupců $M$ je ortonormálních, a to plyne z předpokladu, že $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ je měření.\n"
"Pro ověření tohoto tvrzení si všimni, že pro každé $j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ je vektor tvořený sloupcem číslo $j$ matice $M$ následující:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi_j\\rangle = M \\vert 0, j\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that here we're numbering the columns starting from column $0.$ Taking "
"the inner product of column $i$ with column $j$ when "
"$i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ gives\n"
msgstr ""
"Všimni si, že zde číslujeme sloupce od sloupce $0.$ Skalární součin sloupce "
"$i$ se sloupcem $j$ pro $i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$ dává\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\langle \\psi_i \\vert \\psi_j \\rangle\n"
"& =\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert i\\rangle\\biggr)^{\\dagger}\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1} \\vert l \\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\sum_{l = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle k \\vert l \\rangle \\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_l \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1}\n"
"\\langle i \\vert \\Pi_k \\vert j\\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\langle i \\vert \\mathbb{I} \\vert j \\rangle\\\\\n"
"& = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & i = j\\\\\n"
"0 & i\\neq j,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "which is what we needed to show.\n"
msgstr "což jsme potřebovali ukázat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus, because the first $n$ columns of the matrix $M$ are orthonormal, we "
"can replace all of the remaining zero entries by some different choice of "
"complex number entries so that the entire matrix is unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Protože tedy prvních $n$ sloupců matice $M$ je ortonormálních, můžeme "
"všechny zbývající nulové položky nahradit jinou volbou komplexních čísel "
"tak, aby celá matice byla unitární.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\Pi_0 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_1 & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\Pi_{m-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we're given the matrices $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1},$ we can compute "
"suitable matrices to fill in for the blocks marked $\\fbox{?}$ in the "
"equation — using the Gram–Schmidt process — but it does not matter "
"specifically what these matrices are for the sake of this discussion.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pokud máme dány matice $\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1},$ můžeme vhodné matice pro"
" dosazení za bloky označené $\\fbox{?}$ v rovnici vypočítat — pomocí Gram-"
"Schmidtova procesu — ale konkrétní podoba těchto matic pro účely této "
"diskuze nehraje roli.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally we can describe the measurement process: we first perform $U$ on the joint system $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ and then measure $\\mathsf{Y}$ with respect to a standard basis measurement.\n"
"For an arbitrary state $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ of $\\mathsf{X},$ we obtain the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Nakonec můžeme popsat proces měření: nejprve provedeme $U$ na společném systému $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ a poté změříme $\\mathsf{Y}$ pomocí měření ve standardní bázi.\n"
"Pro libovolný stav $\\vert \\phi \\rangle$ systému $\\mathsf{X}$ získáme stav\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= M \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle \\vert \\phi\\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\Pi_k \\vert\\phi\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the first equality follows from the fact that $U$ and $M$ agree on their first $n$ columns.\n"
"When we perform a projective measurement on $\\mathsf{Y},$ we obtain each outcome $k$ with probability\n"
msgstr ""
"kde první rovnost plyne z toho, že $U$ a $M$ se shodují ve svých prvních $n$ sloupcích.\n"
"Když provedeme projektivní měření na $\\mathsf{Y},$ získáme každý výsledek $k$ s pravděpodobností\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|^2,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "in which case the state of $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ becomes\n"
msgstr "přičemž stav $(\\mathsf{Y},\\mathsf{X})$ se v tom případě změní na\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert k\\rangle \\otimes \\frac{\\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle}{\\bigl\\| \\Pi_k \\vert \\phi\\rangle \\bigr\\|}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus, $\\mathsf{Y}$ stores a copy of the measurement outcome and "
"$\\mathsf{X}$ changes precisely as it would had the projective measurement "
"described by $\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ been performed directly on "
"$\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Tedy $\\mathsf{Y}$ uchovává kopii výsledku měření a $\\mathsf{X}$ se změní "
"přesně tak, jako by projektivní měření popsané "
"$\\{\\Pi_0,\\ldots,\\Pi_{m-1}\\}$ bylo provedeno přímo na $\\mathsf{X}.$\n"
